{"seq":3,"slug":"tech-blog-writing","title":"技术博客写作英语","url":"/l-doc-books/h/english-learning/programmer-english/technical-reading-writing/tech-blog-writing","wordCount":1866,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"技术博客写作英语\">技术博客写作英语</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>技术博客写作是&quot;技术写作&quot;与&quot;吸引读者&quot;两种目标的交汇。它有一套被读者与搜索引擎广泛认可的结构约定：<strong>标题承诺价值 → 开头勾住读者并预告收益 → 正文分节递进 → 结尾给出可带走的要点</strong>。每一段都在回答读者心中的一个具体问题。</p>\n<p>其中最关键的是<strong>开头与结尾</strong>这两处&quot;杠杆点&quot;：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>开头</strong>要在 3–4 句内完成三件事——勾住读者、建立上下文、预告价值；常用问题导入、数据导入、故事导入三种模式</li>\n<li><strong>正文</strong>靠过渡短语（顺序 / 因果 / 转折 / 补充）维持逻辑连贯</li>\n<li><strong>结尾</strong>用 Key Takeaways 把散落的要点压缩成可带走的清单</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[技术博客写作] --&gt; B[标题 承诺价值]&#10;    A --&gt; C[开头 3-4 句]&#10;    A --&gt; D[正文 分节递进]&#10;    A --&gt; E[结尾 Key Takeaways]&#10;    C --&gt; F[勾住读者]&#10;    C --&gt; G[建立上下文]&#10;    C --&gt; H[预告价值]&#10;    D --&gt; I[过渡短语 顺序/因果/转折]&#10;    E --&gt; J[压缩为可带走要点]&#10;    F --&gt; K[读者读完并记住]&#10;    I --&gt; K&#10;    J --&gt; K\">graph TD\n    A[技术博客写作] --&gt; B[标题 承诺价值]\n    A --&gt; C[开头 3-4 句]\n    A --&gt; D[正文 分节递进]\n    A --&gt; E[结尾 Key Takeaways]\n    C --&gt; F[勾住读者]\n    C --&gt; G[建立上下文]\n    C --&gt; H[预告价值]\n    D --&gt; I[过渡短语 顺序/因果/转折]\n    E --&gt; J[压缩为可带走要点]\n    F --&gt; K[读者读完并记住]\n    I --&gt; K\n    J --&gt; K</pre><p>在此之上还有一条与教程类博客体例不同的支线：<strong>build-in-public</strong>——用第一人称、时间锚与真实数字记录造物过程，卖的是进展与反思而非教学。两者共享同一套语法要点：主动语态、精确动词、短句。</p>\n<h2 id=\"技术博客的文章结构\">技术博客的文章结构</h2><p>英文技术博客有一套被读者广泛认可的结构约定。遵循这些结构不仅让文章更易阅读，也更容易被搜索引擎收录和技术社区转载。</p>\n<h3 id=\"标准文章结构\">标准文章结构</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Title                          ← 吸引读者点击&#10;Introduction (Hook + Context)  ← 为什么读者需要这篇文章&#10;Table of Contents (可选)       ← 长文提供导航&#10;Main Content (2-5 sections)    ← 核心价值内容&#10;Code Examples                  ← 可运行的代码片段&#10;Conclusion / Key Takeaways     ← 总结核心要点&#10;Call to Action (可选)          ← 引导读者下一步\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Title                          ← 吸引读者点击</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Introduction (Hook + Context)  ← 为什么读者需要这篇文章</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Table of Contents (可选)       ← 长文提供导航</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Main Content (2-5 sections)    ← 核心价值内容</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Code Examples                  ← 可运行的代码片段</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Conclusion / Key Takeaways     ← 总结核心要点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Call to Action (可选)          ← 引导读者下一步</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"标题写作技巧\">标题写作技巧</h3><p>好的标题应当明确传达文章价值，让读者在标题层面就能判断是否值得阅读：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"# Good — 具体、有价值承诺&#10;&quot;How We Reduced API Latency by 80% with Connection Pooling&quot;&#10;&quot;A Practical Guide to Database Migrations Without Downtime&quot;&#10;&quot;Understanding React Server Components: What Changes for Your App&quot;&#10;&quot;5 TypeScript Patterns That Eliminated Runtime Errors in Our Codebase&quot;&#10;&#10;# Bad — 模糊、缺乏信息量&#10;&quot;My Thoughts on Databases&quot;&#10;&quot;React Tips&quot;&#10;&quot;Some Useful Patterns&quot;&#10;&quot;Things I Learned&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># Good — 具体、有价值承诺</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"How We Reduced API Latency by 80% with Connection Pooling\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"A Practical Guide to Database Migrations Without Downtime\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Understanding React Server Components: What Changes for Your App\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"5 TypeScript Patterns That Eliminated Runtime Errors in Our Codebase\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># Bad — 模糊、缺乏信息量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"My Thoughts on Databases\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"React Tips\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Some Useful Patterns\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Things I Learned\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p>标题格式选择：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>格式</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>How to / How We...</td>\n<td>教程/经验</td>\n<td>&quot;How to Set Up CI/CD with GitHub Actions&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Understanding X</td>\n<td>概念解释</td>\n<td>&quot;Understanding the Event Loop in Node.js&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>X vs Y</td>\n<td>对比分析</td>\n<td>&quot;REST vs GraphQL: When to Use Which&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>N Things/Ways/Patterns</td>\n<td>清单文</td>\n<td>&quot;7 Git Workflows That Scale&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Why X / Why Not Y</td>\n<td>观点论述</td>\n<td>&quot;Why We Switched from MongoDB to PostgreSQL&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Building X with Y</td>\n<td>实战项目</td>\n<td>&quot;Building a Real-time Chat App with WebSockets&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"开头段落的写作\">开头段落的写作</h2><p>技术文章的开头需要在 3-4 句话内完成三件事：<strong>勾住读者</strong>、<strong>建立上下文</strong>、<strong>预告价值</strong>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三种有效的开头模式\">三种有效的开头模式</h3><p><strong>问题导入法</strong>——从读者的痛点出发：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Have you ever deployed a database migration and watched your application&#10;crash because of a missing column? You&#39;re not alone. In this post,&#10;I&#39;ll share a zero-downtime migration strategy that has worked reliably&#10;for our team across 200+ production deployments.\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Have you ever deployed a database migration and watched your application</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>crash because of a missing column? You're not alone. In this post,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>I'll share a zero-downtime migration strategy that has worked reliably</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>for our team across 200+ production deployments.</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>数据/事实导入法</strong>——用具体数字建立可信度：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Our API was serving 50,000 requests per minute with a p99 latency of&#10;800ms. After implementing the optimizations described in this post,&#10;we brought that down to 120ms — a 6.7x improvement — without adding&#10;any hardware.\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Our API was serving 50,000 requests per minute with a p99 latency of</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>800ms. After implementing the optimizations described in this post,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>we brought that down to 120ms — a 6.7x improvement — without adding</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>any hardware.</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>故事导入法</strong>——用真实经历吸引注意：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Last Tuesday at 3 AM, our on-call engineer received a page: the payment&#10;service was returning 500 errors for 30% of requests. What followed was&#10;a 4-hour debugging session that revealed a subtle race condition in our&#10;distributed lock implementation. Here&#39;s what we learned.\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Last Tuesday at 3 AM, our on-call engineer received a page: the payment</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>service was returning 500 errors for 30% of requests. What followed was</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>a 4-hour debugging session that revealed a subtle race condition in our</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>distributed lock implementation. Here's what we learned.</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"开头中的关键短语\">开头中的关键短语</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"&quot;In this post, I&#39;ll walk you through...&quot;       — 本文将带你了解...&#10;&quot;By the end of this article, you&#39;ll be able to...&quot; — 读完后你将能够...&#10;&quot;This guide covers...&quot;                          — 本指南涵盖...&#10;&quot;We&#39;ll explore...&quot;                              — 我们将探索...&#10;&quot;Let&#39;s dive into...&quot;                            — 让我们深入了解...&#10;&quot;Here&#39;s what we&#39;ll cover:&quot;                      — 以下是我们将涵盖的内容：\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>\"In this post, I'll walk you through...\"       — 本文将带你了解...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"By the end of this article, you'll be able to...\" — 读完后你将能够...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"This guide covers...\"                          — 本指南涵盖...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"We'll explore...\"                              — 我们将探索...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Let's dive into...\"                            — 让我们深入了解...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Here's what we'll cover:\"                      — 以下是我们将涵盖的内容：</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"正文段落的衔接\">正文段落的衔接</h2><h3 id=\"段落间的过渡短语\">段落间的过渡短语</h3><p>好的技术文章在段落之间有自然的逻辑过渡，帮助读者跟随思路：</p>\n<p><strong>顺序/步骤</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"&quot;First, let&#39;s look at...&quot;            — 首先看看...&#10;&quot;Next, we need to...&quot;                — 接下来需要...&#10;&quot;Now that we have X, let&#39;s...&quot;       — 现在有了 X，让我们...&#10;&quot;With that in place, we can...&quot;      — 到位之后，就可以...&#10;&quot;The final step is to...&quot;            — 最后一步是...\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>\"First, let's look at...\"            — 首先看看...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Next, we need to...\"                — 接下来需要...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Now that we have X, let's...\"       — 现在有了 X，让我们...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"With that in place, we can...\"      — 到位之后，就可以...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"The final step is to...\"            — 最后一步是...</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>因果关系</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"&quot;This matters because...&quot;            — 这很重要因为...&#10;&quot;As a result, ...&quot;                   — 因此...&#10;&quot;This leads to...&quot;                   — 这导致...&#10;&quot;The reason for this is...&quot;          — 原因在于...&#10;&quot;Consequently, ...&quot;                  — 相应地...\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>\"This matters because...\"            — 这很重要因为...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"As a result, ...\"                   — 因此...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"This leads to...\"                   — 这导致...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"The reason for this is...\"          — 原因在于...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Consequently, ...\"                  — 相应地...</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>对比与转折</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"&quot;However, there&#39;s a catch...&quot;        — 然而有个坑...&#10;&quot;On the other hand, ...&quot;             — 另一方面...&#10;&quot;While this works, it has limitations...&quot; — 虽然可行，但有局限...&#10;&quot;That said, ...&quot;                     — 话虽如此...&#10;&quot;In contrast to X, Y...&quot;             — 与 X 对比，Y...\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>\"However, there's a catch...\"        — 然而有个坑...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"On the other hand, ...\"             — 另一方面...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"While this works, it has limitations...\" — 虽然可行，但有局限...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"That said, ...\"                     — 话虽如此...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"In contrast to X, Y...\"             — 与 X 对比，Y...</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>补充与强调</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"&quot;It&#39;s worth noting that...&quot;          — 值得注意的是...&#10;&quot;One important caveat: ...&quot;          — 一个重要注意事项...&#10;&quot;Keep in mind that...&quot;               — 请记住...&#10;&quot;A common misconception is...&quot;       — 一个常见误解是...&#10;&quot;Pro tip: ...&quot;                       — 技巧提示...\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>\"It's worth noting that...\"          — 值得注意的是...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"One important caveat: ...\"          — 一个重要注意事项...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Keep in mind that...\"               — 请记住...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"A common misconception is...\"       — 一个常见误解是...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Pro tip: ...\"                       — 技巧提示...</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"代码片段的嵌入与解释\">代码片段的嵌入与解释</h2><h3 id=\"代码前的导入语\">代码前的导入语</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"&quot;Here&#39;s what the implementation looks like:&quot;&#10;&quot;Let&#39;s see this in action:&quot;&#10;&quot;Consider the following example:&quot;&#10;&quot;The key function looks like this:&quot;&#10;&quot;Here&#39;s a minimal reproduction:&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>\"Here's what the implementation looks like:\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Let's see this in action:\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Consider the following example:\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"The key function looks like this:\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Here's a minimal reproduction:\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"代码后的解释语\">代码后的解释语</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"&quot;Let&#39;s break this down line by line:&quot;&#10;&quot;The important parts here are:&quot;&#10;&quot;Notice how we...&quot;&#10;&quot;A few things to note:&quot;&#10;&quot;The magic happens on line 5, where...&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>\"Let's break this down line by line:\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"The important parts here are:\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Notice how we...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"A few things to note:\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"The magic happens on line 5, where...\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"代码注释的英语\">代码注释的英语</h3><p>代码块中的注释应当简洁且为读者服务：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// Configure the rate limiter with a sliding window&#10;const limiter = new RateLimiter({&#10;  windowMs: 60 * 1000, // 1-minute window&#10;  maxRequests: 100, // limit each IP to 100 requests per window&#10;  skipFailedRequests: true, // don&#39;t count failed requests&#10;});&#10;&#10;// Apply to all API routes&#10;app.use(&#39;/api&#39;, limiter);&#10;&#10;// Note: This must be applied BEFORE authentication middleware&#10;// to prevent brute-force attacks on the login endpoint\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Configure the rate limiter with a sliding window</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> limiter</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RateLimiter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  windowMs: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">60</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 1-minute window</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  maxRequests: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// limit each IP to 100 requests per window</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  skipFailedRequests: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// don't count failed requests</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Apply to all API routes</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">app.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">use</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/api'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, limiter);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Note: This must be applied BEFORE authentication middleware</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// to prevent brute-force attacks on the login endpoint</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"结尾与总结的写法\">结尾与总结的写法</h2><h3 id=\"key-takeaways-格式\">Key Takeaways 格式</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"markdown\" data-code=\"## Key Takeaways&#10;&#10;- Connection pooling reduced our p99 latency from 800ms to 120ms&#10;- The optimal pool size depends on your query patterns — start with `connections = (cores * 2) + effective_spindle_count`&#10;- Always monitor pool exhaustion metrics in production&#10;- Consider using PgBouncer for connection-level pooling at scale\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## Key Takeaways</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Connection pooling reduced our p99 latency from 800ms to 120ms</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> The optimal pool size depends on your query patterns — start with </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">`connections = (cores * 2) + effective_spindle_count`</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Always monitor pool exhaustion metrics in production</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Consider using PgBouncer for connection-level pooling at scale</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"结尾段落的常用表达\">结尾段落的常用表达</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"&quot;To sum up, ...&quot;                     — 总结一下...&#10;&quot;In summary, ...&quot;                    — 综上...&#10;&quot;The key insight here is...&quot;         — 核心洞察是...&#10;&quot;I hope this helps you...&quot;           — 希望这能帮助你...&#10;&quot;If you found this useful, ...&quot;      — 如果这对你有用...&#10;&quot;Feel free to reach out if...&quot;       — 如有问题欢迎联系...&#10;&quot;Have you encountered this problem?&quot; — 你遇到过这个问题吗？\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>\"To sum up, ...\"                     — 总结一下...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"In summary, ...\"                    — 综上...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"The key insight here is...\"         — 核心洞察是...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"I hope this helps you...\"           — 希望这能帮助你...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"If you found this useful, ...\"      — 如果这对你有用...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Feel free to reach out if...\"       — 如有问题欢迎联系...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Have you encountered this problem?\" — 你遇到过这个问题吗？</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"行动号召-call-to-action\">行动号召（Call to Action）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"&quot;Try implementing this in your next project and let me know how it goes.&quot;&#10;&quot;The full source code is available on GitHub: [link]&quot;&#10;&quot;What patterns have you found helpful? Share in the comments below.&quot;&#10;&quot;Follow me on X for more posts like this.&quot;&#10;&quot;If you&#39;d like to dive deeper, check out [related resource].&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>\"Try implementing this in your next project and let me know how it goes.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"The full source code is available on GitHub: [link]\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"What patterns have you found helpful? Share in the comments below.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Follow me on X for more posts like this.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"If you'd like to dive deeper, check out [related resource].\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"build-in-public-写作框架\">Build-in-public 写作框架</h2><p>&quot;Build-in-public&quot;（公开造物）是独立开发者与创业者越来越常用的写作模式：边做产品边写过程。和传统教程类技术博客不同，build-in-public 文章卖的是<strong>真实进展 + 反思 + 数据</strong>，结构更松，但句式与术语有自己的惯例。</p>\n<h3 id=\"build-in-public-的三种主要载体\">Build-in-public 的三种主要载体</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>载体</th>\n<th>典型平台</th>\n<th>节奏</th>\n<th>长度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Newsletter</td>\n<td>Substack / Beehiiv / Ghost</td>\n<td>每周 1 期</td>\n<td>800-1500 词</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Dev community blog</td>\n<td>dev.to / Hashnode</td>\n<td>每个里程碑 1 篇</td>\n<td>1000-3000 词</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Public log / changelog</td>\n<td>个人站点、GitHub Discussions</td>\n<td>持续追加</td>\n<td>200-500 词/条</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三者可以并行：里程碑写长文到 dev.to，周报压缩成 newsletter，零碎进展贴 public log。</p>\n<h3 id=\"build-in-public-文章的特征句式\">Build-in-public 文章的特征句式</h3><p>不同于教程类博客的&quot;How to...&quot;，build-in-public 文章常用第一人称叙事 + 时间标记 + 数字：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"&quot;This week, I shipped X, learned Y, and walked away with Z.&quot;&#10;&quot;Week 14: revenue is at $X MRR. Here&#39;s what changed and what didn&#39;t.&quot;&#10;&quot;I spent 30 hours rewriting our onboarding flow. Conversion went from 12% to 28%.&quot;&#10;&quot;Last month I committed to building in public. Here are the unfiltered results.&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>\"This week, I shipped X, learned Y, and walked away with Z.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Week 14: revenue is at $X MRR. Here's what changed and what didn't.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"I spent 30 hours rewriting our onboarding flow. Conversion went from 12% to 28%.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Last month I committed to building in public. Here are the unfiltered results.\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意三个共性：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>时间锚</strong>（&quot;this week&quot; / &quot;week 14&quot; / &quot;last month&quot;）—— 让读者跟得上进度</li>\n<li><strong>第一人称单数 I</strong>（而非教程文的 &quot;we&quot;）—— 体现&quot;我个人在做&quot;的孤独感与可信度</li>\n<li><strong>具体数字</strong>（hours / dollars / conversion %）—— 区别于含糊的&quot;做了不少&quot;</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"进展段落的写作模式-wins-losses-lessons\">进展段落的写作模式（Wins / Losses / Lessons）</h3><p>Build-in-public 文章的核心段落常用三段对照：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"## What worked&#10;&#10;- Launched the new pricing page; trial-to-paid conversion went from 4.2%&#10;  to 7.1% in 9 days.&#10;- AI-generated 4 blog drafts; 2 went live with light edits.&#10;&#10;## What didn&#39;t&#10;&#10;- Cold email outreach: 200 sent, 3 replies, 0 demos. Killed the channel.&#10;- Spent 6 hours wrestling with Stripe webhooks for a 30-min feature.&#10;&#10;## What I learned&#10;&#10;- Pricing page copy is leverage I undervalued for 3 months.&#10;- &quot;Solved by AI in 10 min&quot; is a brittle plan when integrations are involved.\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>## What worked</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- Launched the new pricing page; trial-to-paid conversion went from 4.2%</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  to 7.1% in 9 days.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- AI-generated 4 blog drafts; 2 went live with light edits.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>## What didn't</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- Cold email outreach: 200 sent, 3 replies, 0 demos. Killed the channel.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- Spent 6 hours wrestling with Stripe webhooks for a 30-min feature.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>## What I learned</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- Pricing page copy is leverage I undervalued for 3 months.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- \"Solved by AI in 10 min\" is a brittle plan when integrations are involved.</span></span></code></pre></div><p>模板套用要点：<strong>Wins 写具体数字，Losses 写具体代价（时间或金钱），Lessons 写一句可迁移的判断</strong>。三段都不要超过 5 个 bullet。</p>\n<h3 id=\"数据展示的英语模式\">数据展示的英语模式</h3><p>Build-in-public 读者期待数据。常用的描述句式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"&quot;MRR is up 18% MoM — from $1,200 to $1,420.&quot;&#10;&quot;Active users plateaued at 230 for the third week running.&quot;&#10;&quot;Churn dropped from 8% to 5% after the onboarding rewrite.&quot;&#10;&quot;Conversion: 4.2% → 7.1% (+69% relative, +2.9pp absolute).&quot;&#10;&quot;Week-over-week signup growth: 12 → 38 → 41 → 29.&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>\"MRR is up 18% MoM — from $1,200 to $1,420.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Active users plateaued at 230 for the third week running.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Churn dropped from 8% to 5% after the onboarding rewrite.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Conversion: 4.2% → 7.1% (+69% relative, +2.9pp absolute).\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Week-over-week signup growth: 12 → 38 → 41 → 29.\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意几个术语：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>术语</th>\n<th>全称 / 含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>MoM</td>\n<td>Month over Month，月环比</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WoW</td>\n<td>Week over Week，周环比</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MRR / ARR</td>\n<td>Monthly / Annual Recurring Revenue，月度 / 年度经常性收入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Churn</td>\n<td>流失率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>pp (percentage points)</td>\n<td>百分点（绝对差） vs % 相对增长</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Plateau (v.)</td>\n<td>进入平台期</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>英语写作易错点</strong>：增长是 18% 时不要写 &quot;by 18 percent&quot;——口语化、不够紧凑；地道写法是 <code>up 18% MoM</code>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"newsletter-邮件的开头与结尾惯例\">Newsletter 邮件的开头与结尾惯例</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>段位</th>\n<th>常见开头</th>\n<th>常见结尾</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>&quot;Hey friends,&quot; / &quot;Hi everyone,&quot;</td>\n<td>&quot;Until next week,&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>&quot;Quick update from week N...&quot;</td>\n<td>&quot;— [Name]&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>&quot;This one&#39;s a long one — grab a coffee.&quot;</td>\n<td>&quot;Reply to this email if you have thoughts.&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>&quot;I&#39;m writing this from [place].&quot;</td>\n<td>&quot;Forward this to one builder you know.&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Newsletter 比博客更&quot;亲密&quot;，可以用 contractions（I&#39;m, you&#39;re, here&#39;s）、第二人称（you / your），以及非正式的过渡词（anyway / so / one more thing）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"与传统教程类博客的体例对照\">与传统教程类博客的体例对照</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>教程类博客</th>\n<th>Build-in-public</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>人称</td>\n<td>We / You</td>\n<td>I</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时态</td>\n<td>现在时（指令）</td>\n<td>过去时 + 现在完成时（叙事）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结构</td>\n<td>Step 1 / 2 / 3</td>\n<td>This week / last month / since launch</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据</td>\n<td>Benchmark 数据</td>\n<td>业务指标（MRR、churn、conversion）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结尾</td>\n<td>Key Takeaways</td>\n<td>What&#39;s next</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>读者关系</td>\n<td>老师对学生</td>\n<td>同行对同行</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"起步建议\">起步建议</h3><p>如果是第一次写 build-in-public：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>先发 3–5 条 <strong>public log</strong>（200 词以内），降低心理门槛</li>\n<li>攒到一个里程碑（首位付费用户 / 首个 1K MRR / 重大重构）再写长文</li>\n<li>长文用上面的 Wins / Losses / Lessons 模板；3 个月后回看会发现数据自带说服力</li>\n<li>不要等&quot;准备好&quot;——build-in-public 的核心价值是过程，不是成品</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"技术写作的语法要点\">技术写作的语法要点</h2><h3 id=\"使用主动语态\">使用主动语态</h3><p>技术写作优先使用主动语态，让句子更直接有力：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"# Passive (被动) — 较弱&#10;&quot;The configuration file is loaded by the application at startup.&quot;&#10;&quot;The error is handled by the middleware.&quot;&#10;&#10;# Active (主动) — 更强&#10;&quot;The application loads the configuration file at startup.&quot;&#10;&quot;The middleware handles the error.&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># Passive (被动) — 较弱</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"The configuration file is loaded by the application at startup.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"The error is handled by the middleware.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># Active (主动) — 更强</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"The application loads the configuration file at startup.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"The middleware handles the error.\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"选择精确动词\">选择精确动词</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"# Weak — 模糊动词&#10;&quot;The function does the validation.&quot;&#10;&quot;This makes the data go to the server.&quot;&#10;&#10;# Strong — 精确动词&#10;&quot;The function validates the input against the schema.&quot;&#10;&quot;This transmits the payload to the upstream server.&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># Weak — 模糊动词</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"The function does the validation.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"This makes the data go to the server.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># Strong — 精确动词</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"The function validates the input against the schema.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"This transmits the payload to the upstream server.\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"保持句子简短\">保持句子简短</h3><p>技术写作中，每句话传达一个核心信息。避免在一句话中堆叠多个从句：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"# Too long&#10;&quot;When the user submits the form, the client-side validation runs first,&#10;and if it passes, the data is sent to the server where the server-side&#10;validation checks for duplicates in the database before creating the record.&quot;&#10;&#10;# Better — 拆分为多句&#10;&quot;Form submission triggers client-side validation first. If validation passes,&#10;the data is sent to the server. The server checks the database for duplicates&#10;before creating the new record.&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># Too long</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"When the user submits the form, the client-side validation runs first,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>and if it passes, the data is sent to the server where the server-side</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>validation checks for duplicates in the database before creating the record.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># Better — 拆分为多句</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Form submission triggers client-side validation first. If validation passes,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>the data is sent to the server. The server checks the database for duplicates</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>before creating the new record.\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"避免-我们-的过度使用\">避免&quot;我们&quot;的过度使用</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"# Overuse of &quot;we&quot;&#10;&quot;We create a new instance. We pass it to the function. We await the result.&quot;&#10;&#10;# Better — 混合使用&#10;&quot;Create a new instance and pass it to the handler function.&#10;The handler processes the request and returns a Promise.&#10;Await the result before proceeding to the next step.&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># Overuse of \"we\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"We create a new instance. We pass it to the function. We await the result.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># Better — 混合使用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Create a new instance and pass it to the handler function.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>The handler processes the request and returns a Promise.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Await the result before proceeding to the next step.\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p>技术博客写作是一种可以系统学习的技能。从模仿优秀的英文技术博客开始——阅读 Vercel Blog、Netflix Tech Blog、Stripe Engineering Blog 等高质量技术博客，分析它们的标题公式、段落结构和过渡手法，然后在自己的写作中有意识地应用这些模式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>技术博客结构遵循「标题承诺 → 开头勾住 → 正文递进 → 结尾要点」的约定</li>\n<li>标题用 <code>How to…</code> / <code>Understanding X</code> / <code>X vs Y</code> / <code>N Things</code> 等格式明确传达价值</li>\n<li>开头 3–4 句完成勾住读者、建立上下文、预告价值；三种模式：问题导入、数据导入、故事导入</li>\n<li>正文用过渡短语（顺序 / 因果 / 转折 / 补充）维持逻辑连贯，代码块前后各有导入语与解释语</li>\n<li>结尾用 Key Takeaways 压缩要点，可加 Call to Action</li>\n<li>build-in-public 是与教程文不同体例的支线：第一人称 I + 时间锚 + 真实数字，核心段落用 Wins / Losses / Lessons</li>\n<li>数据描述遵循英语惯例（<code>up 18% MoM</code>、<code>pp</code> 表示百分点），掌握 MoM / WoW / MRR / Churn 等术语</li>\n<li>语法要点：主动语态优于被动、精确动词优于模糊动词、短句优于堆叠从句</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"技术博客写作英语","id":"技术博客写作英语"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"技术博客的文章结构","id":"技术博客的文章结构"},{"level":3,"text":"标准文章结构","id":"标准文章结构"},{"level":3,"text":"标题写作技巧","id":"标题写作技巧"},{"level":2,"text":"开头段落的写作","id":"开头段落的写作"},{"level":3,"text":"三种有效的开头模式","id":"三种有效的开头模式"},{"level":3,"text":"开头中的关键短语","id":"开头中的关键短语"},{"level":2,"text":"正文段落的衔接","id":"正文段落的衔接"},{"level":3,"text":"段落间的过渡短语","id":"段落间的过渡短语"},{"level":2,"text":"代码片段的嵌入与解释","id":"代码片段的嵌入与解释"},{"level":3,"text":"代码前的导入语","id":"代码前的导入语"},{"level":3,"text":"代码后的解释语","id":"代码后的解释语"},{"level":3,"text":"代码注释的英语","id":"代码注释的英语"},{"level":2,"text":"结尾与总结的写法","id":"结尾与总结的写法"},{"level":3,"text":"Key Takeaways 格式","id":"key-takeaways-格式"},{"level":3,"text":"结尾段落的常用表达","id":"结尾段落的常用表达"},{"level":3,"text":"行动号召（Call to Action）","id":"行动号召-call-to-action"},{"level":2,"text":"Build-in-public 写作框架","id":"build-in-public-写作框架"},{"level":3,"text":"Build-in-public 的三种主要载体","id":"build-in-public-的三种主要载体"},{"level":3,"text":"Build-in-public 文章的特征句式","id":"build-in-public-文章的特征句式"},{"level":3,"text":"进展段落的写作模式（Wins / Losses / Lessons）","id":"进展段落的写作模式-wins-losses-lessons"},{"level":3,"text":"数据展示的英语模式","id":"数据展示的英语模式"},{"level":3,"text":"Newsletter 邮件的开头与结尾惯例","id":"newsletter-邮件的开头与结尾惯例"},{"level":3,"text":"与传统教程类博客的体例对照","id":"与传统教程类博客的体例对照"},{"level":3,"text":"起步建议","id":"起步建议"},{"level":2,"text":"技术写作的语法要点","id":"技术写作的语法要点"},{"level":3,"text":"使用主动语态","id":"使用主动语态"},{"level":3,"text":"选择精确动词","id":"选择精确动词"},{"level":3,"text":"保持句子简短","id":"保持句子简短"},{"level":3,"text":"避免\"我们\"的过度使用","id":"避免-我们-的过度使用"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"PR 与 Code Review 英语","url":"/l-doc-books/h/english-learning/programmer-english/technical-reading-writing/pr-code-review-english"},"next":{"title":"AI Prompt 英语","url":"/l-doc-books/h/english-learning/programmer-english/technical-reading-writing/ai-prompt-english"}}